Content-app lookups behind a file HEAD request (the ``index.html`` probe, the directory listing and the exact file lookup) now check repository membership per matching row instead of walking the whole repository version's content set. The ``index.html`` probe is skipped for file paths and directory listings are capped at 10,000 entries. These queries rely on the ``core_ca_relpath_pattern_idx`` index added by migration 0024.
